WEBVTT

00:06:56.537 --> 00:07:00.583
which supported the idea
of managing sustainably

00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:03.085
and harvesting resources sustainably.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:07.131
We're also beginning to see

00:07:07.173 --> 00:07:10.050
that, in our world, where we live,

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:12.136
there is an emphasis on kinship,

00:07:12.178 --> 00:07:14.472
relationship and social capital

00:07:14.472 --> 00:07:18.184
which underpins an equitable

00:07:18.225 --> 00:07:21.312
and connected economy and society.

00:07:21.729 --> 00:07:26.108
Which is also the currency
which my people still use today.

00:07:28.861 --> 00:07:34.158
We have spiritual practices
which understand all of this